<!--
  Sample HCM Extract output, standing in for what the extract writes to UCM.

  Every record here exists to exercise one case the file has to get right, and
  the cases were chosen from what actually goes wrong with a loan feed rather
  than from the happy path. docs/test-cases.md lists them with the expected
  result; tests/ asserts them.

    100501  ordinary active loan
    100502  two concurrent loans - the reason the detail grain is the loan
    100503  loan paid off this period
    100504  terminated mid-period, final repayment taken
    100505  refinance - old loan settled, new loan opened, same period
    100506  suspended, unpaid leave, balance outstanding, nothing withheld
    100507  negative repayment, a reversed deduction
    100508  rehire with a loan carried across the break in service
    100509  accented and over-long name, and an em dash
    100510  REJECT - no loan number on the element entry
    100511  REJECT - element name not in PFG_401K_LOAN_TYPE
    100512  REJECT - no national identifier
    100513  zero balance, final zero row telling Principal the loan closed
    100514  REJECT - amount wider than the column
    100515  REJECT - legal employer on a different contract
-->
